WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.379
They have neither the sincerity
nor the passion

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:07.257
to implement any of them!

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:13.888
If you disagree with my observations,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.601
it doesn't matter who you are...

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:19.769
SENIOR MATH CLUB

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:20.937
Hey.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:24.232
Hi, we're looking for the
Archaeology Club.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:27.485
Upstairs. Look for the Lit Club sign.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:28.903
Thanks.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:40.081
I THINK, THEREFORE I AM

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.292
At last, inquiring minds!

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:45.003
The Philosophy Club wants you.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:49.382
New members! How long has it been?

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:52.427
My struggle was not in vain.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:57.265
We're just heading for the
Archaeology Lit Club, actually.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.644
Now don't be shy.
Shall we discuss existentialism?

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.022
Or perhaps you prefer Nietzsche?

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.403
Chem Club! How dare you
disturb our contemplation?

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.282
Better run, you guys.
You'll be there all day.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.786
Show some respect,
you second-rate alchemists.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:21.664
At least we do experiments.
Your ideas can't even be proved.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:27.337
‘New poets! Draw energy
from clouds, light, storms...’

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.007
‘Show us the direction
humanity should take...’

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.260
‘A Copernicus for a new age,
to set us free...’

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.429
CQ! CQ!

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.265
This is a high school student from Japan.

